  <title type="title-main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Characteristics of a fibre and cable with non-zero dispersion for wideband optical transport</title>
  <title type="main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Characteristics of a fibre and cable with non-zero dispersion for wideband optical transport</title>
